OL,3,CTeenager arrested for attempted murder
OL,4,Cafter 'driving at police'
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after
OL,8,Fallegedly driving at police officers
OL,9,Fin Leicester.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said the
OL,12,Fincident happened in Tudor Road today
OL,13,F(Monday, August 3).
OL,15,FOfficers were responding to a reported
OL,16,Fburglary when a vehicle allegedly made
OL,17,Foff and rammed five parked cars and
OL,18,Fwas allegedly driven at police.
OL,20,FThe force's dog unit was also deployed
OL,21,Fto the incident, police said.
