OL,3,CTeenager arrested for attempted murder
OL,4,Cafter 'driving at police'
OL,6,FThe teenager was arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof attempted murder, dangerous driving
OL,8,Fand causing criminal damage.
OL,10,FHe remains in custody.
OL,12,FA force spokesperson said: "The
OL,13,Fincident happened in Tudor Road at
OL,14,Faround 4.15am today (Monday, August 3).
OL,16,F"A 17-year-old has been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of attempted murder,
OL,18,Fdangerous driving and causing criminal
OL,19,Fdamage. He remains in custody at this
OL,20,Ftime."
